# The repo-root .gitignore has a generic Python `lib/` rule that would swallow
# the frontend's typed API client (lib/api/). Re-include it — it's source, not
# a build artifact. (`frontend/` isn't ignored, so this negation is allowed.)
!lib/
!lib/**
